    "face": "1024x1024 atlas from supplied photograph; TPS anatomical x/z UV landmark remap; hair and eye pixel exclusion; alpha feather; per-vertex front-depth support; attenuated low-frequency illumination; unseen surfaces constant warm skin plus procedural pores.",
